#: scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ed15137944916468457370bea7654344c4c808c89b0f11613363570335c274f
#. default-sha256: 9df54e6192c0979225c5912d0ff02696cff039e3c75b346d2c0cfc14d5858d11
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_72DD4588_D919_4D40_BBCF_10DF9071DC19"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫All I wanted... ⟪k:1⟫was to go back to the way things used to be..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫我只是，⟪k:1⟫想回到……从前那样而已……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60410e1fc7648828afcec4bba97fcdca8eeec6f619d1626d4a28f468634a339e
#. default-sha256: 9593ff575fc351dcf87d2b769bee1429a2a77de4f785eb064a6eaeb28ca38f41
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_01DC8432_29AC_498E_8127_F1AD66CE1DDB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫for us... ⟪k:1⟫to be able to smile around each other..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只是想……能和你相顾一笑……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6f33afe30abb6415a7528c03cfa321748a0bd12c9c0aabe687243931f159d555
#. default-sha256: fbbafce5065d77466811b717ec80ebb94d89d20298f28a2036a768e902b88f16
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_25F5F851_BFB4_432D_AA33_50BD5DFE8B65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫It had been several days since Jacopo had locked her in the shed,⟪k:5⟫"
"and her day-to-day life was only growing more arduous."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫经过数日之后——⟪k:5⟫她的生活变得更加艰辛。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6708a8bcaef739c25baed036ecf8cad28c500708eed24f5d2dbbf96503a7947b
#. default-sha256: c18f82679c21a1e9ac24db6b5e7c49843337f7e74755421efe3e0253fbe5bd67
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_76ED8843_768C_428F_BF16_59040FFF0399"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was under constant surveillance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫雅各布如他所说的那样，⟪k:1⟫监视着她的行动。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0c95d7475df276b619237bff3558f67716d074d8cf1d8adc2231f81ad36a1dd6
#. default-sha256: 23b46d514e00037472716b33c27a377f23605bc6f4bb64d5da8b837a8192b176
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D63AC5CD_BE9C_4C09_8D08_7FF9D24AC514"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The door was only unlocked to deliver her meals, three times a day."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只有一日三餐的时间，⟪k:1⟫小屋的门锁才会被开启。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d6231f349b14ea1f6584b4ff85906afc79c00ac96f9b72ca7b04c86194eca2e7
#. default-sha256: 2efd7b15c5b74b919abd4b819d1b015b81bb4723ff375d02ad1f1ca7a25aa62e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5E0ECD43_A9F7_47DE_B584_A98423B18D9E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And despite what an unfortunate situation their employer’s wife found herself in, the maids "
"chattered and gossiped and giggled freely."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫明明她身处如此可怜的境况下，⟪k:1⟫女仆们却热衷于传闲话，⟪k:2⟫暗地里偷笑着。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: adbcab5c8cbc90090b95752ab81330748ecbe91bbec0689d68b57b434658a74e
#. default-sha256: e46af4e23936bc79cf41716f63cf8040a60ac3777f1a341c6e67b3d5e9f5839d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_ABAB1144_F8DD_44EA_ADD4_9EA3ED993684"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not even in the shadows, out of her presence—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the tactless young maidservants "
"whispered directly to the White-Haired Girl when they brought her meals."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫在看不见的地方偷偷议论也就罢了，⟪k:1⟫坏心眼的女仆甚至在送饭的时候直接在她耳边小声说。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ae7654cdcc5b186eaf6460d2ab1db0c4972f52403fd2dccb34f817d4c970770
#. default-sha256: 4ed8259178ca74de849941b5fc818a97ce011a1d8aaa1ef5ec86c5b4745455ac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9D6D222B_02A2_461F_8BBA_9C81BD4803FD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫“Look at you, Madam. Caged away like cattle.”"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫「夫人您这样，简直和家畜一样呀」"

#: scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c702fda43d6168ab97bc5da5418593066dfa593d44028fec726d28b16712312b
#. default-sha256: 7e28e4d4deacc6c053c2d59c6a02b1316a0b0355fa3c17e9dbddd4395904d093
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_0236D815_8CAC_4C3B_B583_610E835AA4EA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I could almost hear the sound of cracks forming in her heart."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……下仆似乎能听到，⟪k:1⟫她的心被道道划开的声音。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 33373de405d02f51622ca40be9b6e85e44502aba812fc55954e3fb11b5657818
#. default-sha256: fe06a11ecd04e3b18ddd6eaa23915e8b51032d99dccd4479db6cfca11c8fd1fc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2BCE54D9_DEE5_487E_90CA_9A57CB8DF929"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine she had gotten to the point where she was having difficulty merely holding herself "
"together. ⟪k:1⟫She had done nothing wrong, and yet she was forced to live this life of insults "
"and mockery."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫可以想象，⟪k:1⟫她已经连维持自我精神都感到痛苦不堪。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫她明明没做错任何事，⟪k:4⟫却要无"
"端被骂，⟪k:5⟫被迫过这种生活。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f59ec8df40090dc42af3d44225de62da503ad982d1ca181b88e2e3d243ad460
#. default-sha256: 8169aff4c6d8adae1fdc7090b2d479d5de531b4a497e6de9b2ecd919afe68e80
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_078106BF_26F7_4D9F_B146_205839DB0BD6"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Of ridicule."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫被他人嘲笑——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 22e4e9dc05964a34f17d9da79ff309ec0de8a0df0b726061959715817851ab48
#. default-sha256: 95c39d6f3042986585c32bf4bdafc763b339d14b944e8ac482d07d2bff16a46a
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB2B0C5C_A288_4438_A0BD_8185567DD586"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The only reason her tenuously held together spirit did not completely shatter was because "
"she still had her one and only ally."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即便如此，⟪k:1⟫让她濒临崩溃的精神得以维持的救命稻草，⟪k:2⟫果然是那位唯一的同伴。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3e726f666937419981fa0f84399dc3be1b0615a4f0d6db6f8aec023ede3d41e
#. default-sha256: 1939a36bd659a588e1afe4566a27381c8a3b6f3c4726582fade0bdde4d994712
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C0D14612_A806_49A7_AD7A_AB2A57C74595"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maid Maria volunteered to attend to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫女仆玛利亚主动申请照顾她。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f2d9ebf08c2a75fd1ceee4459945335a8fbf292c44b927f5311320d70942c4f
#. default-sha256: 69aa10b854113517c05e7e47b8bd25fee32c2c63170b3a02f143062bd9f78a3b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7211AC07_1F5C_4E7B_AA4D_1E09E86C26C4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria took over the duty of delivering her three meals, meaning the other maids stopped "
"coming by."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫一日三餐变成由玛利亚来送，⟪k:1⟫其他的女仆不再接近——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b329a486c0077171e28c1a77e24e6d5fd56e05b6d60b39a1277f1f6c7af513f0
#. default-sha256: 23da2c35edab99798d7ecaeb85cfe0242287f5d24335d9526c045ebc281c486c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_712172B1_5B9F_4386_BF8A_59BC684D38C0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And that relieved the White-Haired Girl’s mental and emotional stress considerably."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这对于白发少女来说也是精神上的救赎。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a46c414f323b3118bce9093af720903cce8579f50fceabd179b182132aeae81b
#. default-sha256: 73b4c10bbbeeaf46a6ea19c754ec03439cbb7bd8178787fd1fc8ddcea293c951
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_014F5C94_F506_45A2_B7F9_BEEA11F15129"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Maria became her sole conversation partner, her sole companion.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She did not leave "
"as soon as meals were finished, instead remaining in the shed with the White-Haired Girl for some "
"time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫玛利亚作为她唯一能交流的对象，⟪k:1⟫与她共同度过时光。⟪k:2⟫即使她用餐完毕，⟪k:3⟫也不立刻回去……"

#: scenario3:scenario3_BCFD5ACC_E8B5_4165_9D19_82B98BCB3AEE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a845cc85050cfda44b467d707192ea3d858d89a201e45340d8c40da03c40d0fc
#. default-sha256: 1fffb9e0ac05617e93e5f7e927f98b62fb3aead38703607190ab62facc20eb4f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_BCFD5ACC_E8B5_4165_9D19_82B98BCB3AEE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫…………"

#: scenario3:scenario3_7A20BE66_CFB9_4A5D_B338_4CA03B9BF20A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 703fc49d9316bcce792fb08436bb69bc258259560a74b578df23491f506a4449
#. default-sha256: 6acd0ff8a216f6b9177e6ad878e4b3118cf11b596b1ee5db2e00e9d234551ad1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_7A20BE66_CFB9_4A5D_B338_4CA03B9BF20A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: scenario3:scenario3_DFC320FD_FEA3_41B0_B8D1_0270A68407BD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fc9c03e81898160d353912b52e4fb7315414046af8a3d718a84e5924721f5df7
#. default-sha256: 2c72966d64c42816a267432c909f24bf7a13acfc3c1ee5d01af0e49bcfdcd5af
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_DFC320FD_FEA3_41B0_B8D1_0270A68407BD"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫S-⟪k:2⟫So, ⟪k:3⟫uh, ⟪k:4⟫Madam, how ’bout a funny story?⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫I flubbed up pretty "
"hard the other day. You wanna hear about that?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫那、⟪k:2⟫那什么，⟪k:3⟫夫人。⟪k:4⟫聊点什么开心的事吧！  ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫给你讲讲之前我工作时犯"
"的蠢事吧，⟪k:7⟫如何？⟪k:8⟫"

#: scenario3:scenario3_378947F8_2A37_4B64_B4E0_BB55B07C4C94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 703fc49d9316bcce792fb08436bb69bc258259560a74b578df23491f506a4449
#. default-sha256: 6acd0ff8a216f6b9177e6ad878e4b3118cf11b596b1ee5db2e00e9d234551ad1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_378947F8_2A37_4B64_B4E0_BB55B07C4C94"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫…………"

#: scenario3:scenario3_69824517_24CF_4B8E_B072_5694C0E5E948
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d12da328af36883c09d8091c4c8cb0e2cf95ab7f4edf60c510ae418c8401a929
#. default-sha256: f39cad579f5261187669659d806a32fbd486d12ae6ec2bf5dabc33a184b6b673
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_69824517_24CF_4B8E_B072_5694C0E5E948"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫So a couple days back, I didn’t get enough sleep the previous night, right? ⟪k:2⟫I’m "
"helping out in the kitchen, half-awake, plating up some food,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫之前因为睡眠不足，⟪k:2⟫迷迷糊糊地在餐厅帮忙。⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫干的是盛菜一类的工作——"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9E019DB4_7BCC_4D2A_862D_33920693D3EF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3de6bf1f3246caafd6f6f4de11029544ad55d1c906cabb174f012e88464e7fc4
#. default-sha256: f44203d1eb042cd20f0d0371d09449171b04dc4fa54ff4d152103f7da7064e59
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9E019DB4_7BCC_4D2A_862D_33920693D3EF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫and when I go to bring it out to the guest, my heart about leaps out of my mouth. Guess why."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫端到客人面前的时候，⟪k:1⟫才发现大事不妙。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫你猜怎么着？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_46EBE330_AB6F_4F2A_9199_BB4397AA1818
